{"id":"l8ger115rk96coksic7o8jv91","title":"葛的别名与用途","originalTitle":"山耕谭葛 葛的词语典故·葛条葛薯及其它 山葛道衣轻 葛条系我履","summary":"《中华本草》和《中药大辞典》记载葛根又名葛条根，葛条根可用于嫁接后固定树木。清代方朝的诗词中提到葛条系鞋履。干葛指豆科植物葛的干燥块根。葛脰指入土五、六寸以上的葛根，形状似颈脖。葛薯是某些葛品种的别称，如江苏的金葛2号和江西的赣饲5号。","reason":null,"source":{"name":"科学网博客"},"links":{"original":"http://blog.sciencenet.cn/home.php?mod=space&uid=3638195&do=blog&id=1560654"},"publishedAt":null,"discoveredAt":"2026-11-11T03:35:32.142Z","timelineAt":"2026-11-11T03:35:32.142Z","category":"gene-cell","tags":["论文发表"],"score":27,"selected":false,"channel":"news","story":null,"x":null,"readingMode":"full","author":null,"body":null,"outline":[],"relatedStories":[],"topics":[{"slug":"conference-paper","name":"顶会与论文接收"}],"indexable":false,"markdownAvailable":true,"group":null,"hasTranslation":false,"bodyLanguage":"original"}